WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
Madam, dinner has been prepared in the side hall.

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:04,240
Your Majesty, please come over and have dinner with us.

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:10,780
Got it. I'll change my clothes and go there.

4
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:15,260
Ayu, come and sit down. This is Pei Zi's signature.

5
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:16,340
Mr. Pei

6
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:21,480
Ah hello madam

7
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,660
Mr. Pei doesn’t need to be polite

8
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:25,740
Mr. Pei, you're welcome. Eat more.

9
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:29,390
Well thank you ma'am

10
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:32,390
Mr. Pei is still used to living in the Hou Mansion these days.

11
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:34,430
If there is anything missing, just tell the servants

12
00:00:34,430 --> 00:00:37,430
Ah, habit, habit, pretty good

13
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:42,460
Prince, madam, I’m full and will go back first.

14
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,860
Mr. Pei walks slowly
